    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: 6aa8126f5a88525fb93d37f4baeec8742d9db82a -->\nReady for the maintainer to merge.\n\nThe review found no blocking items.\n\n- `LocateBody::default()` is `LocateBody::Part`. The added field preserves the test's intended behavior.\n- This PR changes one test fixture. It changes no product code, G-code, collision checks, stock simulation code, geometry code, or golden files.\n- This PR changes no UI files. Screenshots are not required.\n\nLocal results after a trial merge with upstream main `fac6c8e8d22cb39bb0a4c18644b4ec1c4dbd2db6`:\n\n- The trial merge had no conflicts.\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-app --no-run -j 6`: passed.\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-app --test stock_in_vise_sim -j 6`: 2 passed, 0 failed.\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets -j 6 -- -D warnings`: passed.\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main --dry-run`: passed. This command lists checks; it does not run them.\n\nThe initial command with sccache stalled and was stopped. All checks listed above passed with the cache disabled. No GitHub runner was used.\n\nMutations: none. This PR only adds a missing field to a test fixture.\n\nRequested before merge: none.\n\nNote: upstream main already has the same fix in commit `9a40e703c`. The tree after the trial merge equals upstream main. This PR adds no further tree changes.\n\nA maintainer will approve and merge by hand.\n",
